vendor/ChainPlanar/ (with vendor/ChainPlanar/vendor/cm24-r2/) contains modules of a
planar and axisymmetric fluid-mechanics Lean library developed by the same project on
Mathlib, included with its own LICENSE and NOTICE. CCPoint/Lib/Vendor/PlanarODE/ and
CCPoint/Lib/Vendor/ParamODE/ contain nine ordinary-differential-equation modules taken
verbatim (import lines re-pointed) from two sibling Lean formalisations by the same
project, keeping their namespace AffineCore. All vendored code is by the same copyright
holder under the same licence.

Dependencies not contained here: Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) and
mathlib4 (Apache 2.0), with mathlib4's standard dependency set fetched at the revisions
in lake-manifest.json. batteries, aesop, Qq, ProofWidgets4, import-graph,
LeanSearchClient and plausible are Apache 2.0; Cli (leanprover/lean4-cli) is MIT.
